.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH grex-init 1  "grex-init "
.SH NAME
grex\-init \- Initialize a grex workspace
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgrex\-init\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIPATH\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Initialize a grex workspace
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIPATH\fR]
Workspace path to initialize. Defaults to the current working directory. The directory is created if it does not exist. The command refuses to overwrite an existing `.grex/pack.yaml` — idempotent only on a fresh tree
